--[[
    DINGOSQUAD
    Stage 1 - UI / Window / Tab Foundation

    Features:
        • CreateWindow()
        • Dynamic tabs
        • Tab switching
        • Permanent Config tab
        • Config tab always at bottom
        • ActivationColor
        • Window destruction
        • Tab destruction
        • Internal state registry
        • UI based on the supplied converted ScreenGui
]]

